        "q1": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Exactly what is in the 6-Week Total Transformation Pack?",
            "answer": "<p>The pack contains 5 full-size products: 1 GutSlim Diet Shake (500g), 1 GutSlim SuperGreens (30 servings), 1 GutSlim GLP-1 Booster (60 capsules), 1 GutSlim Fat Burner (60 capsules), and 1 GutSlim Tummy Toner (60 capsules).</p>"
