        "q2": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much do I save with this total transformation stack?",
            "answer": "<p>You pay R1,990.50 for the pack compared to R2,546.95 when purchasing the 5 items individually (Diet Shake R529.00, SuperGreens R599.00, GLP-1 Booster R520.00, Fat Burner R549.00, Tummy Toner R349.95). That is an exact saving of R556.45.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I take all 5 products during the 6 weeks?",
            "answer": "<p>Use Diet Shake as a daily meal replacement and drink 1 scoop of SuperGreens with water. Take GLP-1 Booster, Fat Burner, and Tummy Toner capsules daily with water according to package directions.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I take these products with antibiotics or during pregnancy?",
            "answer": "<p>If taking antibiotics, space probiotic capsules at least 2 to 3 hours apart. If you are pregnant or nursing, please consult your healthcare professional before use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do any of these products require refrigeration?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Velobiotics microencapsulation creates a protective micro-shield around each bacterium, ensuring shelf-stability at room temperature.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I am not satisfied with my results?",
            "answer": "<p>We stand behind our products with a 30-day money-back guarantee. Contact our team at <a href=\"mailto:support@velobiotics.com\">support@velobiotics.com</a> for assistance.</p>"
